WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.906 --> 00:00:23.229
never thought I'd be so glad to see Wormwood again!"

2
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:26.232
Perda thought as everyone stepped out of the wormhole.

3
00:00:26.252 --> 00:00:30.255
"Who has the cup?"

4
00:00:30.635 --> 00:00:31.116
she asked.

5
00:00:31.972 --> 00:00:32.993
Zann looked sheepish.

6
00:00:33.013 --> 00:00:36.695
"I guess I dropped it as we jumped into the vortex."

7
00:00:36.715 --> 00:00:38.577
"My pendant!"

8
00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:41.279
Mellis cried, picking something up from the ground.

9
00:00:41.899 --> 00:00:43.320
Tears filled her eyes.

10
00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.641
"I thought I'd never see it again."

11
00:00:46.522 --> 00:00:48.163
Darb and Gliss ran toward them.

12
00:00:48.884 --> 00:00:51.746
Zing chirped with joy and flew to meet Darb.

13
00:00:51.766 --> 00:00:54.287
"Where did you guys go?"

14
00:00:54.768 --> 00:00:55.428
Gliss asked.

15
00:00:55.448 --> 00:00:57.690
"You disappeared for a second."

16
00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:58.810
"A second?"

17
00:00:59.231 --> 00:00:59.771
Zann said.

18
00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:00.832
"Are you kidding?

19
00:01:01.408 --> 00:01:02.708
We were gone for weeks!"

20
00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:04.249
Gliss laughed.

21
00:01:04.889 --> 00:01:05.849
"No way!

22
00:01:06.429 --> 00:01:08.550
We just saw you a moment ago."

23
00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.551
"Hmm," Perda said.

24
00:01:10.571 --> 00:01:14.692
"The time vortex must have returned us to the same moment we left.

25
00:01:15.392 --> 00:01:18.733
So to everyone here, it's as if we weren't gone at all."

26
00:01:18.753 --> 00:01:20.813
"The time vortex?"

27
00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:24.835
Darb glanced up from scratching Zing's head and noticed Mellis.

28
00:01:24.855 --> 00:01:27.855
"Oh, hello," he said politely.

29
00:01:28.796 --> 00:01:29.896
Mellis didn't respond.

30
00:01:30.396 --> 00:01:33.618
She was staring around, her eyes wide with wonder.

31
00:01:33.638 --> 00:01:36.239
"Can this truly be Terrica?"

32
00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.961
"No, it's Magica," Gliss said.

33
00:01:39.981 --> 00:01:42.623
"Did you just arrive through the wormhole?"

34
00:01:43.463 --> 00:01:44.223
Zann nodded.

35
00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:48.966
Then he and Perda took turns telling their friends everything that had happened.

36
00:01:48.986 --> 00:01:52.508
"Wow!" Gliss and Darb said together.

37
00:01:53.228 --> 00:01:56.030
After that, the friends gave Mellis a tour of the city.

38
00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:00.132
They visited the palace, the zoo, and Zann's favorite park.

39
00:02:01.208 --> 00:02:03.049
"This place Mellis said.

40
00:02:03.069 --> 00:02:04.470
"It's amazing!"

41
00:02:05.571 --> 00:02:11.354
At last they stopped in at Zann's parents' lab, where Boz, Asta, and Nax were waiting.

42
00:02:11.374 --> 00:02:15.036
"We were about to send a message moth," Nax said.

43
00:02:15.056 --> 00:02:16.937
"It's almost time for dinner."

44
00:02:16.957 --> 00:02:19.198
"Great," Zann said.

45
00:02:19.219 --> 00:02:22.160
"But first, we have something to tell you guys."

46
00:02:22.921 --> 00:02:24.902
He quickly told them about their adventures.

47
00:02:25.702 --> 00:02:29.436
His mom seemed especially interested in Mellis.

48
00:02:29.456 --> 00:02:32.097
"Mellis is an unusual name," Asta said.

49
00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:37.640
"I was just reading about Queen Mellis, the first elected ruler of Magica."

50
00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.101
She grabbed a dusty old book.

51
00:02:40.781 --> 00:02:44.603
"She lived a long time ago, before history was being recorded.

52
00:02:45.303 --> 00:02:49.124
Later, during the Old Times, her descendants wrote about her.

53
00:02:49.685 --> 00:02:55.927
They were trying to convince people to return to the peaceful, prosperous times that existed under her rule."

54
00:02:56.488 --> 00:02:57.308
Boz nodded.

55
00:02:57.812 --> 00:03:03.055
"Her natural magic powers were stronger than anyone's before or since.

56
00:03:03.996 --> 00:03:09.019
She was able to defeat everyone who tried to harm Magica during her lifetime."

57
00:03:10.119 --> 00:03:11.440
Gliss glanced at Mellis.

58
00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.161
"Is that you?"

59
00:03:13.862 --> 00:03:14.882
Mellis didn't answer.

60
00:03:15.542 --> 00:03:16.883
Her face had gone pale.

61
00:03:16.903 --> 00:03:19.525
"It must be her," Perda thought.

62
00:03:19.545 --> 00:03:22.206
"But she looks scared."

63
00:03:23.047 --> 00:03:24.628
Perda squeezed Mellis' hand.

64
00:03:25.608 --> 00:03:29.329
"Mellis is probably a common name in your time, right?"

65
00:03:29.349 --> 00:03:31.810
"But what if it's not?"

66
00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:32.750
Mellis said.

67
00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:40.812
"What if it's my destiny to defeat Zira and help Terrica—I mean, Magica—to become peaceful?"

68
00:03:40.832 --> 00:03:45.113
"Zira will be waiting to take you prisoner," Zann said.

69
00:03:45.773 --> 00:03:50.215
Perda remembered how Mellis had swept Zira and her goons away with one word.

70
00:03:50.235 --> 00:03:53.495
"It's okay," she told Zann.

71
00:03:53.515 --> 00:03:55.396
"I think Mellis can handle it."

72
00:03:56.444 --> 00:03:57.645
"I think I can too."

73
00:03:58.165 --> 00:04:00.487
Mellis' voice was quiet but assured.

74
00:04:00.507 --> 00:04:05.090
"You guys taught me so much, including how to be brave."

75
00:04:06.031 --> 00:04:07.752
She smiled at Perda and Zann.

76
00:04:07.772 --> 00:04:13.156
"Besides, I can't abandon the people I care about, like Anso and my other friends."

77
00:04:14.157 --> 00:04:14.717
She sighed.

78
00:04:14.737 --> 00:04:17.639
"And even my uncle."

79
00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:20.021
She looked at the group.

80
00:04:20.041 --> 00:04:23.944
"Thank you for showing me what Magica will be someday.

81
00:04:24.784 --> 00:04:26.585
Now I'll know what I'm fighting for."

82
00:04:28.265 --> 00:04:32.226
After dinner Perda and her friends zapped back to Wormwood with Mellis.

83
00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:34.987
"We don't have the cup," Zann said.

84
00:04:35.007 --> 00:04:38.468
"I hope Mellis' pendant will work to open the wormhole instead."

85
00:04:38.488 --> 00:04:42.049
"I've been thinking about that cup," Perda told him.

86
00:04:42.069 --> 00:04:45.510
"I think you dropped it because you had to.

87
00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.090
Otherwise, it would exist twice in our time."

88
00:04:49.931 --> 00:04:51.191
Zann looked confused.

89
00:04:52.171 --> 00:04:52.871
"What do you mean?"

90
00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:55.353
"I agree," Mellis said.

91
00:04:55.373 --> 00:04:59.356
"The cup exists here as an ancient relic in your parents' lab.

92
00:05:00.097 --> 00:05:04.741
Who knows what would happen if a newer version of the same cup suddenly existed here at the

93
00:05:04.781 --> 00:05:05.401
same time?"

94
00:05:06.122 --> 00:05:07.163
Perda smiled at her.

95
00:05:07.763 --> 00:05:10.746
Mellis was so smart, thoughtful, and brave.

96
00:05:11.506 --> 00:05:15.630
After all their adventures together, she definitely felt like a true friend.

97
00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.392
"I'll miss you," Perda told her.

98
00:05:19.313 --> 00:05:20.093
Mellis hugged her.

99
00:05:20.113 --> 00:05:21.575
"I'll miss you too.

100
00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:22.776
All of you."

101
00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.640
She pulled out her pendant.

102
00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.381
"Thanks for everything."

103
00:05:27.361 --> 00:05:31.362
As the wormhole swirled open, she stepped in and disappeared.

104
00:05:32.383 --> 00:05:36.704
The wormhole closed, but the pendant popped back out and landed on the ground!

105
00:05:37.384 --> 00:05:38.225
Zann picked it up.

106
00:05:38.845 --> 00:05:39.585
"She dropped it!"

107
00:05:40.325 --> 00:05:41.305
Perda shook her head.

108
00:05:41.325 --> 00:05:43.406
"She had to drop it.

109
00:05:44.266 --> 00:05:49.388
Another version of this pendant still exists in her time, even if she can't find it."

110
00:05:50.412 --> 00:05:53.933
Perda wasn't sure she understood exactly how time travel worked.

111
00:05:54.413 --> 00:05:56.334
But she planned to think more about it.

112
00:05:56.354 --> 00:05:58.734
"It's getting dark," Gliss said.

113
00:05:59.555 --> 00:06:00.935
She reached for Darb's hand.

114
00:06:00.955 --> 00:06:04.836
"Let's zap back to Zann's house and get ready to go home."

115
00:06:05.556 --> 00:06:06.437
She zapped away.

116
00:06:07.057 --> 00:06:12.538
Darb had been playing with Zing, so the little dragon disappeared with them, leaving Perda and Zann alone.

117
00:06:12.558 --> 00:06:14.579
"I guess we should go too."

118
00:06:15.419 --> 00:06:16.379
Zann looked wistful.

119
00:06:16.399 --> 00:06:18.280
"Happy birthday, Perda.

120
00:06:18.804 --> 00:06:20.565
I hope you guys can visit again soon."

121
00:06:20.585 --> 00:06:21.866
"Me too."

122
00:06:22.546 --> 00:06:24.467
Perda squeezed the pendant in her hand.

123
00:06:25.148 --> 00:06:29.210
She knew that Zann would miss her most of all, just as she always missed him when they

124
00:06:29.230 --> 00:06:29.790
were apart.

125
00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:34.133
She thought about Gliss holding Darb's hand and suddenly had an idea.

126
00:06:34.153 --> 00:06:41.377
"Sure, Zann and I are both perfectly capable of zapping on our own," she thought with a smile.

127
00:06:42.017 --> 00:06:44.858
"But that doesn't mean we can't zap together once in a while."

128
00:06:45.539 --> 00:06:47.440
She grabbed his hand and squeezed it.

129
00:06:47.936 --> 00:06:50.941
His eyes went wide, and his cheeks turned pink.

130
00:06:51.762 --> 00:06:53.885
Perda could feel her cheeks turn pink too.

131
00:06:54.686 --> 00:06:57.370
But she smiled and squeezed Zann's hand again.

132
00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.074
"Zap!" she said happily.
